{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30115","headline":"监试莲花峰 · 刘得仁","name":"监试莲花峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"太华万余重，迢嶤只此峰。\n当秋倚寥泬，入望似芙蓉。\n翠拔千寻直，青危一朵穠。\n气分毛女秀，灵有羽人踪。\n倒影侵官路，流香激庙松。\n尘埃终不及，车马自憧憧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘得仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30115.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30115","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}